### Step 1 — Log in to get a token
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Step 1 — Wrong password returns 401
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### Step 2 — Protected route without a token returns 401
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/profile

### Step 2 — Protected route with a token (paste the access_token from step 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
